<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="페이지-1" id="W46gnphaLLRyEiBBuolM">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1717" dy="937" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    participant UI as UI 기력 바\n    participant CPC as 클라 PlayerController\n    participant CPS as 클라 PlayerState\n    participant SPC as 서버 PlayerController\n    participant SPS as 서버 PlayerState\n\n    Note over UI,SPS: 평시 — 회복분은 복제하지 않는다\n    loop 서버 매 프레임\n        SPS-&gt;&gt;SPS: Tick 에서 Energy 증가, ServerTime 갱신\n    end\n    SPS--&gt;&gt;CPS: EnergySync 복제, 초당 1회\n    CPS-&gt;&gt;CPS: OnRep_Energy 로 기준점 교체\n    loop 클라 매 프레임\n        CPS-&gt;&gt;CPS: GetEnergyPredicted, 서버시각 델타로 회복분 추정\n        CPS-&gt;&gt;UI: GetEnergyDisplayed 값 브로드캐스트\n    end\n\n    Note over UI,SPS: 기물 명령 — 소비\n    UI-&gt;&gt;CPC: 클릭, OnSetTargetReleased\n    CPC-&gt;&gt;CPS: HasEnuoughEnergy, 표시값 기준 선검증\n    CPS--&gt;&gt;CPC: true\n    CPC-&gt;&gt;CPS: ApplyLocalPredictedConsumeEnergy\n    CPS-&gt;&gt;CPS: PendingLocalConsume 증가\n    CPS-&gt;&gt;UI: 즉시 감소 반영, RTT 대기 없음\n    CPC-&gt;&gt;SPC: CommandRPC, Server Reliable\n    SPC-&gt;&gt;SPC: IsLegalCommand 재검증, 서버 권위\n\n    alt 검증 통과\n        SPC-&gt;&gt;SPS: ConsumeEnergy\n        SPS-&gt;&gt;SPS: Energy 차감, ServerTime 갱신, ConfirmedConsumeSeq 증가\n        SPS-&gt;&gt;SPS: ForceNetUpdate 로 1Hz 대기 무시\n        SPS--&gt;&gt;CPS: EnergySync 즉시 복제\n        CPS-&gt;&gt;CPS: OnRep_Energy, Acked 만큼 PendingLocalConsume 회수\n        CPS-&gt;&gt;UI: 예측값과 서버값 합류\n        SPC-&gt;&gt;SPC: ProcessCommand 실행\n    else 검증 실패\n        Note over SPC,CPS: ConsumeEnergy 미호출, Seq 그대로\n        Note over CPS: PendingLocalConsume 가 회수되지 않고 남음\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="2">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
